From: Mahendra Mali (Max) <max@maxnet.lan>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:30:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] net: ipv4: clamp default TCP rmem and wmem bounds to prevent socket buffer memory exhaustion

================================================================================
MAXNET High-Performance Kernel Engine & Hardware Architecture Optimization
Engineered & Developed by Mahendra Mali (Max) for MAXNET Router OS
Copyright (c) 2026 Mahendra Mali - Max. All Rights Reserved.
================================================================================

On memory-constrained embedded routing platforms (512MB RAM), default Linux
TCP auto-tuning calculates max_rshare and max_wshare socket buffers based on
total physical pages, allowing single TCP streams to balloon up to 16MB.

When concurrent multi-gigabit connections run alongside local services
(such as Samba, DuFS WebDAV, or Tailscale VPN tunnels), unconstrained socket
memory buffers rapidly consume SLUB and page-allocator headroom, triggering
aggressive direct reclaim and OOM kills.

This MAXNET TCP acceleration patch:
1. Clamps maximum default TCP receive buffer (sysctl_tcp_rmem[2]) and transmit
   buffer (sysctl_tcp_wmem[2]) to 4MB (4,194,304 bytes).
2. Maintains complete saturation of 2.5G/5G line rates (supporting >6 Gbps at
   5ms RTT bandwidth-delay product) while strictly bounding total TCP kernel
   footprint under high concurrent connection loads.

Signed-off-by: Mahendra Mali (Max) <max@maxnet.lan>
---
 net/ipv4/tcp.c | 12 ++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

--- a/net/ipv4/tcp.c
+++ b/net/ipv4/tcp.c
@@ -4876,8 +4876,16 @@ void __init tcp_init(void)
 	init_net.ipv4.sysctl_tcp_rmem[0] = PAGE_SIZE;
 	init_net.ipv4.sysctl_tcp_rmem[1] = 131072;
-	init_net.ipv4.sysctl_tcp_rmem[2] = max(131072, max_rshare);
+	/* MAXNET TCP Acceleration & Memory Guard by Mahendra Mali (Max):
+	 * Clamp maximum per-socket TCP memory buffer to 4MB (4194304 bytes)
+	 * to sustain full multi-gigabit routing without memory starvation.
+	 * Copyright (c) 2026 Mahendra Mali - Max. All Rights Reserved.
+	 */
+	init_net.ipv4.sysctl_tcp_rmem[2] = min_t(int, max(131072, max_rshare), 4194304);
 
 	init_net.ipv4.sysctl_tcp_wmem[0] = PAGE_SIZE;
 	init_net.ipv4.sysctl_tcp_wmem[1] = 16384;
-	init_net.ipv4.sysctl_tcp_wmem[2] = max(65536, max_wshare);
+	init_net.ipv4.sysctl_tcp_wmem[2] = min_t(int, max(65536, max_wshare), 4194304);
 
 	init_net.ipv4.sysctl_tcp_comp_sack_delay_ns = NSEC_PER_MSEC;
